            </note>
            <note corresp="#d82-f3" n="3" xml:id="d82-f3-content">
                <p>Telegram 98, September 19, from Trieste to the Department, repeated to Rome as
                    103, to Belgrade as 70, not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d82-f4" n="4" xml:id="d82-f4-content">
                <p>News of the United States protest was released to the press on September 24. See
                    Department of State <hi rendition="#italic">Bulletin</hi>, October 5, 1947, p.
                    706.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
